From 35e734ce3a50b04bf1f60f8ef6849c63b3a9488e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanidhya Awasthi <sanidhya.awasthi@bfhl.in>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 15:01:19 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] [AI] Fix selected balance counting unselected split children

When a split parent was selected together with only some of its children,
the selected balance dropped the children and summed the parent instead,
so every child of the split was counted - including the ones that were
never selected.

Drop the parent when any of its children are selected and keep the
selected children, so only what the user selected is counted. A parent
selected on its own is unchanged and still contributes the whole split.

Closes #5525
